# Allowlist: the build context is ONLY what the image needs. Everything else --
# .env with real keys, .venv, .git, logs, tests -- never reaches the daemon, so it
# can never be baked into a layer by accident (deleting a file in a later layer
# does NOT remove it from the image history).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!knowledge/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
